What this licence covers
------------------------

It covers the Switch port's own work in this repository: the game hooks and
native renderer (port/src), the small launcher helpers kept for the game
(port/launcher), the svrfmt helpers (port/modmaker/svrfmt), the tools
(port/tools, tools/) and the documentation (docs/).

It does NOT cover:

- The ReXGlue SDK under sdk/ (BSD-3-Clause; see sdk/LICENSE), including the
  Horizon (Nintendo Switch) layer adapted from the public NFSMW-NX and SA2-NX
  projects.
- Third-party code under third_party/ and sdk/thirdparty/. Each keeps its own
  licence; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the LICENSE file in each folder.
- The Bink reader/writer in port/launcher/bink_decode.c, bink_encode.c and
  bink_tables.h. It is derived from FFmpeg and stays under FFmpeg's licence,
  the GNU LGPL 2.1 or later.
- The patches in port/patches. They modify other projects (the ReXGlue SDK,
  plume, XenosRecomp) and are under the licences of the projects they patch.
- The game itself. No game files, game code, art, audio or video from WWE
  SmackDown vs. Raw 2011 or any other game are in this repository, and none
  are licensed by it. You need your own legally obtained copy of the game.
  WWE, SmackDown, Raw and all related names and logos are trademarks of their
  owners; THQ / Yuke's own the original game. This project is not affiliated
  with or endorsed by any of them.
- NVIDIA DLSS. Its SDK is not in this repository and is not used by the
  Switch build.

